{
  "//": "STARBOY BD — Firestore composite indexes. WHY: every query that combines a where() (eq) with an orderBy() needs a composite index, otherwise Firestore throws and the app silently falls back to downloading the WHOLE collection (huge read-quota waste). Deploy with: `firebase deploy --only firestore:indexes` (Firebase CLI), OR just open the site, watch the browser console for 'The query requires an index' links and click each one. This file documents exactly which indexes are required.",
